# The hourly read-path build (decision 056): the backstop for a change the
# listener missed. At one past, because Pacific midnight falls on the hour in
# both PST and PDT, and until a build runs after it, "today" is a day no build
# has reached. supercronic runs this in UTC, which for an hourly job is the same.
1 * * * * /app/fly/build.sh
